## Scope

Move the current local MiniLM configuration out of its constructor chain into
one versioned registry file. Do not add a selector, alternate entry, daemon or
behavior change.

## Exit criteria

- A characterization test freezes current query and passage vectors, dimension
  and vector key before the extraction.
- The singleton entry carries the incumbent model, revision, graph/dtype,
  pooling, normalization, templates, window and dimension explicitly.
- The characterization stays green after the extraction.
